1
00:00:01,103 --> 00:00:07,169
It is 4:40. School has just moved Mia's pickup to 5:15, and Alex's train is late.

2
00:00:07,619 --> 00:00:10,280
One change, and the whole evening comes apart.

3
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:14,252
Relay Home rebuilds it, and asks before it acts.

4
00:00:16,846 --> 00:00:24,151
This kitchen display stands in for Alexa+. Behind it are a self-hosted MCP server and an Agent Skill.

5
00:00:25,082 --> 00:00:31,405
One sentence. The agent reads the household, checks helpers and dinners in parallel, and drafts a plan.

6
00:00:32,392 --> 00:00:37,939
Every card on the screen is an MCP Apps view, served by the server in a sandboxed frame.

7
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:44,967
Lee lives closest, but is not on the school's pickup list. Relay will not suggest Lee.

8
00:00:47,358 --> 00:00:52,379
Asking another adult to collect a child is not something an assistant should do on its own.

9
00:00:54,085 --> 00:00:58,266
So the tool answers input required, and the question comes to the person.

10
00:00:59,288 --> 00:01:04,129
Only a yes records the request. The pickup is not covered until Jo says so.

11
00:01:07,306 --> 00:01:11,439
Relay makes Jo a private link, and shows it as a code for Jo's phone.

12
00:01:12,283 --> 00:01:15,848
The page behind it holds one question, and can do nothing else.

13
00:01:17,063 --> 00:01:23,145
Jo taps yes. The display hears it within seconds, and the card now reads: confirmed from their phone.

14
00:01:25,532 --> 00:01:31,134
Dinner needs spinach. Relay gets a signed quote from the shop and asks for the exact total.

15
00:01:32,144 --> 00:01:37,494
Yes, and the order is placed once, inside the weekly cap. The evening card updates itself.

16
00:01:40,693 --> 00:01:42,539
Later, something comes up for Jo.

17
00:01:44,542 --> 00:01:50,572
Relay draws the plan again. With nobody else on the school list in time, it stops, and names no one.

18
00:01:53,112 --> 00:02:01,915
Twelve tools over Streamable HTTP, on both protocol revisions. Every rule lives in the server, and thirty-three tests hold them.

19
00:02:02,115 --> 00:02:09,170
In this recording, Gemini drives the agent through the skill. A Strands agent drives the same server from a terminal.

20
00:02:12,033 --> 00:02:17,347
A changed pickup should not derail the whole evening. Relay Home: it asks before it acts.
